{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH56XRV79CF089ZBFGT9Z89","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 気づいたら楽屋やレッスンの時、近くにきょんこがいることが多いです。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n きょんこ〜〜(*´꒳`*)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH56YPY33ZVMMJ7PG7M5C2T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n きょんこはーと。"}],"source":"archive"}